caption:
” The second Lil Wayne comes in over Tyler, The Creator @feliciathegoat’s smooth, brass-heavy production, the whole car instantly feels like a different kind of listening session. Wayne’s verse is packed with clever wordplay and effortless flows, while the warm horns give the track that laid-back jazz-inspired feel. It might only be a little over a minute long, but Wayne manages to make every second count.

Y’all running this back, or nah?

@rapwire247

